<<
/Title (Our envisioned solution is a low-pressure karaoke support system that responds to anxiety across the user journey. This direction was chosen because our user journey showed that anxiety begins before arrival, increases during song selection, and continues during participation. By combin smartwatch and tablet interactions, the concept aims to suppoet preparation before arrival, safer song selection, and lower-pressure participation during the session.)
